sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna
    participant View as "Web View (auth.reset-password)"
    participant C as ResetPasswordController
    participant U as "User Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pengguna->>View: Buka link reset /reset-password/{token}?email=...
    View->>C: showResetForm(token, email)
    C-->>View: Render form reset (token + email)

    Pengguna->>View: Isi password baru + konfirmasi, submit POST /reset-password
    View->>C: reset(token, email, password, password_confirmation)

    C->>C: Validasi request (token, email, password)
    C->>DB: Password::reset(...)
    DB->>DB: Cek token di password_reset_tokens + cek email di users

    alt Data valid (token dan email sah)
        C->>U: Set password baru (hash) + remember_token baru
        U->>DB: UPDATE users SET password=?, remember_token=? WHERE email=?
        C->>DB: DELETE token terpakai dari password_reset_tokens
        C-->>View: Redirect ke login + flash success
        View-->>Pengguna: Login ulang dengan password baru
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + pesan token/email tidak valid
        View-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan error
    end
